sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Frontend
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant Q as Redis queues
  participant W as Workers
  participant L as Ollama (local LLM)
  participant D as PostgreSQL

  U->>A: POST /documents (files)
  A->>A: check API key, size, real file type (magic bytes)
  A->>D: insert document (queued), SHA-256 exact-duplicate check
  A->>Q: enqueue ingest
  A-->>U: 202 Accepted + document ids
  loop every 2 s until finished
    U->>A: GET /documents/{id}
    A-->>U: status, stage, pages done / total
  end
  Q->>W: ingest: open file, classify each page (text layer or scan)
  W->>Q: OCR batches of 20 scanned pages (run in parallel)
  Q->>W: OCR: deskew, denoise, binarise, Tesseract, store text + confidence
  W->>W: split pages into invoices (header and "page x of y" cues)
  W->>W: rules extractor (labels, regex, line arithmetic)
  alt rules complete and arithmetic consistent
    W->>W: accept, method = rules
  else fields missing or inconsistent
    W->>L: page text + JSON schema, temperature 0
    L-->>W: structured JSON with evidence snippets
    W->>W: grounding check: values not found in source text become null
  end
  W->>W: validation rules, duplicate and cross-check matching
  W->>L: embed invoice summary
  W->>D: invoices, line items, issues, embedding, events
  W->>D: document status = completed / needs_review / failed
